{"title":"ASIA TEAM (Mock AIME II 2013)","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <i>ASIA TEAM</i> Mock AIME was written by AoPS users BOGTRO, fermat007, yugrey, and USAMOREAPER, all from the Academy for the Advancement of Science and Technology.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems\"> Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Answer Key (page does not exist)\"> Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 6\"> Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ASIA TEAM Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_Problems/Problem_9&am